section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>报名时间</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>2026年6月13日至2026年7月5日。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动时间</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>分两批举行，每批为期一周，七月中下旬、八月中下旬各一批。两批营员统一筛选，入选者可自行选择参与批次。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动地点</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>中国科学院金属研究所</span><span><span>（中国科大材料学院）</span></span><span>，沈阳。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动形式</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为期7天的科研体验活动，实践项目由学术大牛所在的课题组或科研骨干团队负责设立并安排优秀导师指导，项目结束后研究所组织结题汇报，汇报通过后颁发荣誉证书。</span></p><p><span>活动期间，研究所统一安排住宿、购买意外伤害保险，并承担往返路费</span><span><span>（飞机经济舱、高铁二等座）</span></span><span>。同时为每名同学提供生活补贴，标准为</span><span><span> 500元/周</span></span><span>。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>Eligibility</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/BTXkdTq7RShULod6E5eAX9qheibGtLJoFyAwcBjZlh6BichsyR3rZo59uvTBQxd2ZDXgkexKk7Afhg5GM56qEGtZzupSJJQCmGBKAfEBqZjxM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、在读2023、2024级全日制本科生；</span></p><p><span>2、有志于科学研究事业，有较好的科研潜力，道德品质良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>3、学业成绩优异；</span></p><p><span>4、具备扎实的外语综合应用能力；</span></p><p><span>5、具有较强的调研分析、问题解决能力；</span></p><p><span>6、身心健康，身体健康符合规定的体检标准；</span></p><p><span>7、材料、化学、物理、加工、冶金、机械、能源、数学、人工智能等相关专业学生均可申请。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><s